# -------------------------------------------------------
# STEP 1 SETUP: Your Secret API Key
# -------------------------------------------------------
# This file is a TEMPLATE. Do the following:
#   1. Copy this file and rename it to just:  .env
#   2. Replace the placeholder below with your real YouTube API key
#   3. Never share your .env file with anyone (it contains your private key)
#
# How to get a free YouTube API key:
#   1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/
#   2. Create a new project (call it anything, e.g. "market-voice")
#   3. Search for "YouTube Data API v3" and click Enable
#   4. Go to Credentials → Create Credentials → API Key
#   5. Copy that key and paste it below (replacing YOUR_KEY_HERE)
# -------------------------------------------------------

YOUTUBE_API_KEY=YOUR_KEY_HERE
